# NOTE: The following large files ARE intentionally tracked:
# sdkdemo/libs/*.aar                       (robot SDK + Vosk + JNA)
# sdkdemo/src/main/jniLibs/**/*.so         (eSpeak native libs)
# sdkdemo/src/main/assets/espeak-ng-data/  (TTS voice data)
# sdkdemo/src/main/assets/model-en-us/     (Vosk EN model)
# sdkdemo/src/main/assets/model-de/        (Vosk DE model)
# These are required for the app to work and must be in the repo.
